{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-09-13-1-week-post-tony-robbins-md-7b85bbe53a:u000002"], "exceptions": [], "goal": {"citations": [{"quote": "Priming is what you do instead. Tony does it every morning. So should you.", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-13-1-week-post-tony-robbins-md-7b85bbe53a:u000002"}], "text": "To manage your daily state positively."}, "kind": "method", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [{"citations": [{"quote": "Priming is what you do instead. Tony does it every morning. So should you.", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-13-1-week-post-tony-robbins-md-7b85bbe53a:u000002"}], "text": "Perform priming every morning."}], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Priming is what you do instead. Tony does it every morning. So should you.", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-13-1-week-post-tony-robbins-md-7b85bbe53a:u000002"}], "text": "Priming is what you do instead of letting thoughts wander and scare you."}, "title": "Daily State Management", "topic": "state_management"}, "content_hash": "d4db8f2cbbbce83a611e5be821a3bc3cb52deddd9cf086e91fd5574efd2f07fb", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-13-1-week-post-tony-robbins-md-7b85bbe53a:knowledge:24400e9e0748c4d3", "metadata_hash": "c716f9e1bac014e611b3cacfad302e80f0ccae700c6dc0dcdab720d6467f07dc", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-09-13T14:06:08Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "682c121f88d4eab94cdc290dae1bc97f66a08c224cc6f4353d8dd075c71d0d2e", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-13-1-week-post-tony-robbins-md-7b85bbe53a", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DdOvG6hAhVu/", "title": "Daily State Management", "topic": "state_management", "topic_slug": "state_management"}
{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-09-13-1-week-post-tony-robbins-md-7b85bbe53a:u000002"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Swap \"everything is going to be bad\" for “I'm interested to see how this day is going to go.\"", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-13-1-week-post-tony-robbins-md-7b85bbe53a:u000002"}], "text": "Replace negative assumptions with curiosity about the day."}, "title": "Change the Question", "topic": "mindset_shift"}, "content_hash": "d4db8f2cbbbce83a611e5be821a3bc3cb52deddd9cf086e91fd5574efd2f07fb", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-13-1-week-post-tony-robbins-md-7b85bbe53a:knowledge:5bc657a530073cd4", "metadata_hash": "c716f9e1bac014e611b3cacfad302e80f0ccae700c6dc0dcdab720d6467f07dc", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-09-13T14:06:08Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "682c121f88d4eab94cdc290dae1bc97f66a08c224cc6f4353d8dd075c71d0d2e", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-13-1-week-post-tony-robbins-md-7b85bbe53a", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DdOvG6hAhVu/", "title": "Change the Question", "topic": "mindset_shift", "topic_slug": "mindset_shift"}
{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-09-13-1-week-post-tony-robbins-md-7b85bbe53a:u000003"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "belief", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Your brain exists to protect you and keep you safe. Which means it is designed to scare you. That is its job. It is not the truth.", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-13-1-week-post-tony-robbins-md-7b85bbe53a:u000003"}], "text": "The brain is designed to scare you as a protective measure, not representing the truth."}, "title": "Beliefs are Protective", "topic": "limiting_beliefs"}, "content_hash": "d4db8f2cbbbce83a611e5be821a3bc3cb52deddd9cf086e91fd5574efd2f07fb", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-13-1-week-post-tony-robbins-md-7b85bbe53a:knowledge:ddc6179636d0eb33", "metadata_hash": "c716f9e1bac014e611b3cacfad302e80f0ccae700c6dc0dcdab720d6467f07dc", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-09-13T14:06:08Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "682c121f88d4eab94cdc290dae1bc97f66a08c224cc6f4353d8dd075c71d0d2e", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-13-1-week-post-tony-robbins-md-7b85bbe53a", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DdOvG6hAhVu/", "title": "Beliefs are Protective", "topic": "limiting_beliefs", "topic_slug": "limiting_beliefs"}
{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-09-13-1-week-post-tony-robbins-md-7b85bbe53a:u000003"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "belief", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "The belief is there so you overcome it. Not once. Every day. It is not a one-time job, it is the job.", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-13-1-week-post-tony-robbins-md-7b85bbe53a:u000003"}], "text": "The belief doesn't break once; it must be overcome daily."}, "title": "Overcoming Beliefs Daily", "topic": "limiting_beliefs"}, "content_hash": "d4db8f2cbbbce83a611e5be821a3bc3cb52deddd9cf086e91fd5574efd2f07fb", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-13-1-week-post-tony-robbins-md-7b85bbe53a:knowledge:cc1ea9ba6f3c4cac", "metadata_hash": "c716f9e1bac014e611b3cacfad302e80f0ccae700c6dc0dcdab720d6467f07dc", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-09-13T14:06:08Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "682c121f88d4eab94cdc290dae1bc97f66a08c224cc6f4353d8dd075c71d0d2e", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-13-1-week-post-tony-robbins-md-7b85bbe53a", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DdOvG6hAhVu/", "title": "Overcoming Beliefs Daily", "topic": "limiting_beliefs", "topic_slug": "limiting_beliefs"}
